**Title:** Whispering Waves: A Coastal Lullaby

**Description:** In this peaceful sleep story, join young Finn and his playful sea otter companion, Ollie, as they embark on a tranquil walk along a serene coastal shoreline. As the golden hues of the sunset transition into the soft twilight blues, Finn discovers the beauty of patience and acceptance in nature's slow artistry. With the rhythmic whispers of the sea and the gentle embrace of the night fog, this soothing narrative invites listeners to drift into a peaceful slumber. Designed to reduce anxiety and foster emotional calm, let the comforting ebb and flow of the ocean lull you into a restful sleep.

